WEBVTT

00:04:55.883 --> 00:05:00.732
And that curve is really hard
for humans to comprehend.

00:05:00.756 --> 00:05:05.539
It's just like our brainwaves
are hard for deep learning to understand.

00:05:05.563 --> 00:05:09.324
So this is not a replication
of human thinking process,

00:05:09.348 --> 00:05:14.389
but an entirely mathematical
classification engine

00:05:14.413 --> 00:05:18.897
that learns from a lot of data
and what humans tell it,

00:05:18.921 --> 00:05:22.793
"This is a cat, this is not,
this is Chris, that's Kai-Fu,"

00:05:22.817 --> 00:05:27.058
and it learns to recognize them
better than people

00:05:27.082 --> 00:05:32.438
if they could see millions
or even billions of pieces of data.